The sorted fp expert gather (qmm_sm80 over sorted rhs indices, from ml-explore/mlx#4554) runs
CTAs per (N tile, expert): a 64-row tile over sorted rows spanned 2-3 experts at Flash Next's
~40 rows each, one serial K-loop per expert run. A popular expert's M tiles split over up to 8
CTAs, and the grid stays near 16k CTAs.

Retires when upstream's sorted-rhs gather schedules per expert. Not reported upstream yet.

